  "description": [
    {
      "ja": "『機動戦士ガンダム 00』よりガンダムデュナメスがついに完全新規造形でMGに登場！",
      "en": "Gundam Dynames from \"Mobile Suit Gundam 00\" finally appears in MG with a completely new model!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• GNスナイパーライフルのスタンドを展開し、本体を地面に伏せた「狙撃」の構えも再現可能。",
      "en": "• It is also possible to recreate the \"sniper\" stance with the GN sniper rifle's stand expanded and the main body face down on the ground."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• スナイプポーズの動きに対応した頭部ギミック、脚部関節構造により緊張感が漂うポージングを再現できる。",
      "en": "• The head gimmick corresponds to the movement of the snipe pose, and the leg joint structure allows you to recreate tense poses."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• GNフル・シールドの展開を再現。",
      "en": "• Reproduce the development of GN Full Seal."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 腰部・膝部のミサイル・信号弾のハッチ開閉やGNスラスターの展開ギミックなどMGならではのギミックを搭載",
      "en": "• Equipped with gimmicks unique to MG, such as opening and closing hatches for missiles and signal bullets on the waist and knees, and deploying GN thrusters."
    }
  ],
